Backport of samtools/htslib d24ed09 (develop, 2026-10-27, Dave Lawrence):
"tabix: stop parsing a record once the columns that matter have been seen".
tbx_parse1 scanned every byte of a VCF line, including all sample columns, to
locate CHROM, POS and the end; a 2,504-sample chr22 region scan spent 65% of its
time there. Drop this patch when the vendored htslib includes the commit.

